The upstream default_rules.yaml file is copied byte for byte. Scanner API,
rule parsing, entropy checks, suppressors, confidence evaluation, and offline
validation were rewritten for direct UTF-8 strings without Gossip-rs engine,
repository, transform, cache, or native-library machinery.

